  lines:
  - english: Two caches secured. Keep going, and protect the evacuation route.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t hai r\u01B0\u01A1ng ti\u1EBFp t\u1EBF.
      Ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 tuy\u1EBFn s\u01A1 t\xE1n."
  - english: Cross the river only on bridges. Use the stairs to reach the raised
      plaza.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1EC9 qua s\xF4ng b\u1EB1ng c\u1EA7u. D\xF9ng b\u1EADc thang
      \u0111\u1EC3 l\xEAn qu\u1EA3ng tr\u01B0\u1EDDng cao."
